From 921b9d3b3a76c5daa6d67f0d9c86f036089addf8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Golle <daniel@makrotopia.org>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 12:59:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 242/243] pipeline: rkisp2: Load the FEC mesh

The ISPP driver enables its FEC stage only with a correction mesh
loaded on the rkispp_fec_mesh device when streaming starts.

Open the mesh device where the ISPP has one, share two mesh buffers
with the IPA, have the IPA fill one with the start controls applied
and queue it before the ISPP starts, and queue a regenerated mesh
whenever the IPA reports a lens control change. A lens model set only
after the start takes effect at the next start.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Daniel Golle <daniel@makrotopia.org>
